    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3376" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκουάζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hear, listen to</i>, c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀοιδοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				13.9
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαιτὸς</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκουάζεσθον</span>
			<i>ye are bidden to</i> the feast, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλεῖσθαι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.343
			</span></i>: Medic., of auscultation, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρὸς τὰ πλευρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					2.61
				</span></i>
			:—
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				423
			</span></i>.</div>
